  "schema:description": "Results of enrichment analysis for S68911 inbred line, VE stage (coleoptile). \nSignificantly enriched nodes are yellow-to-orange colored, according to decrease of adjusted p-value.\nAnalysis was performed using the BiNGO module of Cytoscape (Maere et al. 2005, https://doi.org/10.1093/bioinformatics/bti551)\n\nKey to node columns:X - sample set\nN - population set\nxx - number of genes from the sample set belonging to a given category\nnn - number of genes from the population set belonging to a given category\ndescription - Gene Ontology category name\npValue - raw p-value\nadjustedPValue - False Discovery Rate (0.05)\nadjusted p-value",
